  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "34902001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "向日葵少女",
          "text": "睡觉……享受全天候无死角的睡眠。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34902002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "很凶的大姐姐",
          "text": "哼，无聊的问题。我拒绝接受采访。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34902003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机油味女孩",
          "text": "假期吗？最近好像经常聊起这个话题呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34902004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机油味女孩",
          "text": "去开阔的地方兜风……嗯，既然是难得的假期，果然还是应该去海边吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34902005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机油味女孩",
          "text": "比如去一个温暖的小岛玩沙滩排球，怎么样？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34902006",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "——视频播放结束。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34902007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "好的，我大概了解大家的想法了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34902008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嗯嗯，有各种各样想做的事情呢……但是，优纪很想知道，主人在假期的时候想要做什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "34902010",
              "text": "想做的事情太多了"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "34902010",
              "text": "或许也是去海边玩吧"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "34902009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34902010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "可以先准备好假期的心愿单。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34902011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "对，列好想做的事情，到时候完成一项就划去一项吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34902012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "但无论如何，还是想和手办们在一起。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34902013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嘿嘿，不愧是主人~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34902014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "说起来……最近我在网上订购了新手办呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34902015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "新的伙伴？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34902016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯，是在「维纳斯群岛」度假的玛莉萝丝和穗香。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34902017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "好哦，等不及要欢迎她们了呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34902018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "治愈系女孩",
          "text": "主人——管理局赠送的旅游招待券到了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34902019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "来得正巧，这下终于……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34902020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绝望系半人鱼",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34902021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绝望系半人鱼",
          "text": "|101|，你的假期……开始了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34902022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绝望系半人鱼",
          "text": "呵呵呵……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
